  "fullDescription": "Watercolor flowers set. Alphabet letters and numbers black, pink gold and gold for monogram, initials. Watercolor floral clipart hand drawn.\n\nBright hand painted watercolor flowers, clipart for wedding invitation, greeting card, thank you card, party invitation, planner sticker, design blog, website, logo, banner, poster, birthday project, flyer, brochure, cover, presentation, print template, scrapbooking artwork, baby shower and so on.\n\nThis set includes 181 items:\n– 23 individual elements in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in);\n– 9 compositions and 5 wreaths in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 5000 px x 6000 px / 16,7 in x 20 in);\n– 1 repeating border and 1 drop in PNG files with transparent background (size 6000 px x 4000 px /20 in x 13,3 in);\n– 9 seamless (repeating) patterns in PNG files with transparent background and 9 seamless patterns in JPEG files with white and colored background (different sizes 6000 px x 6000 px / 20 in x 20 in and 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 5 gold frames in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 8 frames for greeting cards in PNG files with transparent background (size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers black color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers gold color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers pink gold color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in).\nCompatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).\nFeel free to send me a message or leave a comment if you have any questions or concerns.\n\nThank you for visiting my shop!",
